      "id": "t31_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": -616,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Vec2 math (no splitting)\n\n`vec2/*` nodes operate on vec2 as one unit. Add, Scale, Length, Normalize all take vec2 inputs and produce vec2 outputs — much cleaner than splitting and recombining.\n\nMake a base vec2, scale it by sin(time), draw an ellipse there.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 220
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Vec2 math (no splitting)\n\n`vec2/*` nodes operate on vec2 as one unit. Add, Scale, Length, Normalize all take vec2 inputs and produce vec2 outputs — much cleaner than splitting and recombining.\n\nMake a base vec2, scale it by sin(time), draw an ellipse there.",
        "width": 420,
